# Intro chat when we first talk to Kyle
if {kyle_met} == false:
	Kyle: It's nice coming home. It would be even nicer if we could get some help making this place liveable again.
	Te: Mama said the city won't rebuild. 
	Kyle: Ain't no money in it for 'em. 
	Te: But they're supposed to help!
	Kyle: Hey now, don't get upset. We got our home back and each other. We don't need them. We'll make it happen. 
	set {kyle_met} = true
else:
	# Random lines after we've met Kyle
	Kyle: <I always wanted to be a chef. I guess I am now./\
Hope you're keeping busy in that garden.>
